<SidebarLayout title="about">
  <img
    src="/images/profile.JPG"
    alt="Profile"
    style="max-width: 100%; height: auto; width: 150px;"
  />
  <h1>Hey! I'm Théo,</h1>
  <p>
    a computer scientist and musician based in Barcelona. I'm currently pursuing
    the <a href="https://www.upf.edu/web/smc" target="_blank"
      >Sound and Music Computing</a
    > master's at Universitat Pompeu Fabra. Before that, I earned my bachelor's degree
    in <a
      href="https://www.upc.edu/en/bachelors/informatics-engineering-barcelona-fib"
      target="_blank">Computer Science</a
    > from Universitat Politècnica de Catalunya and spent two years working at a
    startup called <a href="https://getsilt.com/en" target="_blank">Silt</a> as an
    AI specialist on computer vision.
  </p>
  <p>
    Music has always been a big part of my life. In my free time, you'll often
    find me at the piano or creating songs under <a
      href="https://open.spotify.com/artist/0Lg9znqqYCcQl1elhFcdIV?si=0zeU7fAfSMGYgBB4sZuPsg"
      target="_blank">Tofu Wizard</a
    >. Right now, I'm exploring the intersection of technology and music for my
    master's thesis, working on audio source separation in music using
    multimodal data.
  </p>
</SidebarLayout>
